<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Server Actions on myCodingsHub</title><link>https://mycodingshub.github.io/tags/server-actions/</link><description>Recent content in Server Actions on myCodingsHub</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><managingEditor>cpro95@gmail.com (myCodingsHub)</managingEditor><webMaster>cpro95@gmail.com (myCodingsHub)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Sun, 26 Oct 2025 20:23:16 +0900</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://mycodingshub.github.io/tags/server-actions/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Next.js 15 데이터 업데이트 완전 정복, Server Actions부터 낙관적 업데이트까지</title><link>https://mycodingshub.github.io/guides/nextjs-15-react-19-best-practices-guide/04-data-updating/</link><pubDate>Sun, 26 Oct 2025 09:18:00 +0900</pubDate><author>cpro95@gmail.com (myCodingsHub)</author><guid>https://mycodingshub.github.io/guides/nextjs-15-react-19-best-practices-guide/04-data-updating/</guid><description>&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;들어가며
&lt;div id="들어가며" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;span
class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
&lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#%eb%93%a4%ec%96%b4%ea%b0%80%eb%a9%b0" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;Next.js 15&lt;/code&gt;와 &lt;code&gt;React 19&lt;/code&gt; 환경에서 데이터를 업데이트하는 방법은 서버 액션(Server Actions), &lt;code&gt;useOptimistic&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;TanStack Query&lt;/code&gt; 등 정말 다양한데요.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Next.js 데이터 수정 Server Actions 하나로 끝내는 법</title><link>https://mycodingshub.github.io/guides/the-nextjs-way-of-thinking/16-nextjs-server-actions-for-data-mutation/</link><pubDate>Sun, 26 Oct 2025 20:23:16 +0900</pubDate><author>cpro95@gmail.com (myCodingsHub)</author><guid>https://mycodingshub.github.io/guides/the-nextjs-way-of-thinking/16-nextjs-server-actions-for-data-mutation/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;결론부터 말씀드리면, 앱 라우터 시대의 데이터 &amp;lsquo;수정&amp;rsquo; 작업은 &amp;lsquo;서버 액션(Server Actions)&amp;lsquo;으로 구현하는 것이 기본이자 정답입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;과거 방식의 한계
&lt;div id="과거-방식의-한계" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;span
class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
&lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#%ea%b3%bc%ea%b1%b0-%eb%b0%a9%ec%8b%9d%ec%9d%98-%ed%95%9c%ea%b3%84" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;과거 페이지 라우터 시절에는 데이터를 &amp;lsquo;가져오는&amp;rsquo; 방법은 공식적으로 제공됐지만, 데이터를 &amp;lsquo;수정하는&amp;rsquo; 명확한 방법은 없었거든요.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>